                                <h2 class="rs-section-title">Building Trust
                                    Through Engineering Excellence for Over 35 Years</h2>
                                <p class="descrip">
                                    At <strong>Mohindra Mechanical Works</strong>, we have been shaping the future
                                    of the printing,
                                    coating, and converting industry for more
                                    than three decades.
                                    We specialise in manufacturing high-performance industrial machines, including
                                    <strong>Rotogravure Printing Machines, Coating
                                        Machines, Lamination Machines, Slitting Machines, and Paper Bag Making
                                        Machines</strong>.
                                    Every machine is <strong>100% made in India</strong>, crafted with precision
                                    engineering and
                                    modern CNC technology at our advanced
                                    manufacturing unit. With a strong network of clients across Asia, Africa, the
                                    Middle East, and Europe, we are proud to
                                    have over <strong>2000 successful installations worldwide</strong>.
                                    We believe in more than just building machines â€” we build long-term partnerships
                                    by providing complete end-to-end
                                    solutions, including <strong>custom design, installation, training, and
                                        after-sales
                                        service</strong>. Our goal is to help every business
                                    improve productivity, quality, and profitability through reliable and innovative
                                    machinery.
                                </p>
